  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> multiply feet by <strong>12</strong>. 1&nbsp;foot = 12&nbsp;inches, so 5&nbsp;ft = 60&nbsp;in and 6&nbsp;ft = 72&nbsp;in. For feet and inches, add the inches: 5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;8&nbsp;in = 68&nbsp;in.</p></div>

