  <section id="formula" aria-labelledby="formula-h">
    <h2 id="formula-h">Feet to Inches Formula</h2>
    <p class="tp-note" style="font-size:17px!important"><span class="tp-kbd">inches = feet &times; 12</span><br><span class="tp-kbd">inches = feet &times; 12 + extra inches</span></p><p>To go back, divide by 12: 75&nbsp;in &divide; 12 = 6 remainder 3, so 6&nbsp;ft&nbsp;3&nbsp;in.</p>
  </section>

