  <section id="decimal" aria-labelledby="decimal-h">
    <h2 id="decimal-h">Decimal Feet to Inches</h2>
    <p>Decimal feet are not feet and inches: 5.5&nbsp;ft is 5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;6&nbsp;in (0.5 &times; 12 = 6), not 5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;5&nbsp;in. Multiply the decimal part by 12 to get the inches; 5.75&nbsp;ft = 5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;9&nbsp;in. See <a href="/how-to-write-height/">how to write height</a> for the right notation.</p>
  </section>

